From 693b3991d0496025dded58bafdf85a06d37213f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:27:17 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): show selected tool settings in Properties

Share the existing command-backed tool form with Properties.
Move catalog browsing and import/export into a separate dock tab.
Keep the creation editor and its original wide layout.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2002
